  "ingredients": [
    "1 (1 pound) sweet potato, with skin",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "2 large eggs",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 (9 inch) unbaked pie crust"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SQr40wuI6C6BaMCzd9l1RNkT0rs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12142-sweet-potato-pie-i_step_1-149e2948ac954e7bbfffd54c2a9a0540.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12142/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place whole sweet potato in pot and cover with water; bring to a boil. Boil until tender when pierced with a fork, 40 to 50 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l4SVkBmLECLKUnYChyUjynxPI4s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12142-Sweet-Potato-Pie-mfs-Step1_001-0e9467350dc4439c903e5785d3997806.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12142/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Remove sweet potato from the pot and run under cold water. Remove and discard skin. Break sweet potato flesh apart and place in a bowl. Add butter and mix with an electric mixer until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S1575gOCibMRTNYdZ8CpUkEMGGU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12142-Sweet-Potato-Pie-mfs-Step2_003-38d078698aba469f819cca4540c87b3c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12142/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sugar, milk, eggs, nutmeg, cinnamon, and vanilla; beat on medium speed until mixture is smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aeg6t7rBI8nmV08nswur2yDtHt0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12142-Sweet-Potato-Pie-mfs-Step5_006-36db27b547874bb383ff3d48bde75886.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12142/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour filling into unbaked pie crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ixkyYDF14Jt9ZPrZmFBTefW2ZUY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12142-Sweet-Potato-Pie-mfs-Step6_008-784acb5374f049c0a67adadbc71b4d5d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12142/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a knife inserted in the center comes out clean, 55 to 60 minutes. Cool completely before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WSdzNE-ey-ffe8oOXlRgpU4SDJA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12142-sweet-potato-pie-i-DDMFS-4x3-a63b16cf54f14c2481b114f00428f84d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12142/step_06.webp"
